Title: Two Scene Test (Blue)
Author: Twopop

INT. ARCHIVE VAULT - NIGHT #1#

Rows of steel shelving. A caged bulb flickers, then steadies.

MARA VOSS (40s, cropped grey hair, long oilskin coat) slips through the door, clutching a red leather LEDGER.

[[Push in on Mara as she clocks the guard.]]

DESMOND (60s, night guard, cardigan) looks up from his desk.

DESMOND
Archive's closed.

MARA
(holding up the ledger)
Not to me it isn't.

She crosses the room, left to right, and sets the ledger on his desk.

DESMOND
Where did you get that?

MARA
Your father.

INT. ARCHIVE STAIRWELL - NIGHT #1A#

Concrete steps spiral down into the dark. Water ticks somewhere below.

Mara stops on the landing and listens.

MARA
Someone has been down here.

DESMOND
Only the pipes.
